1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,850
- You're talking about Leonard.
- No, no.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:09,250
(Sheldon:)Shilly-Shally has red hair and
briefly served in the Mexican Navy.

3
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:15,080
(Sheldon:)Anyway, despite the fact
that he has a girlfriend...

4
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:17,530
(Sheldon:)...Shilly-Shally has been the recipient...

5
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:21,240
(Sheldon:)...of inappropriate workplace flirtations
from a young lady.

6
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:24,440
- It's your assistant Alex, isn't it?
- No.

7
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:29,290
No, it's Tondelaya della Ventimiglia.

8
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,640
What the hell is going on
with Leonard and Alex?

9
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,250
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, who's talking about
Leonard and Alex?

10
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:39,450
(Penny:)Fine. Ricardo and Tondelaya.

11
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,440
(Sheldon:)It's not really about
Ricardo and Tondelaya.

12
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,600
(Sheldon:)It is really about her boss...

13
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:49,450
(Sheldon:)...who doesn't quite know how to handle
this situation and could use your advice...

14
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:53,450
(Sheldon:)...which is surprising, because
Dr. Einstein Von Brainstorm...

15
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:57,330
(Sheldon:)...he's usually pretty smart
about these things.

16
00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:59,570
Ugh. I'm gonna kill her!

17
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:03,020
(Bernadette:)You've got nothing to worry about.
Leonard would never cheat on you.

